	(text "Each position: a jumper to DISP_VCC, DISP_BL_SW (switched backlight) or GND, else 47R to its FPGA pin.\nDefaults for GND, VCC, SCL, SDA, RES, DC, CS, BLK: JP to GND on 1, VCC on 2, BLK on 8\nbridged. An FPGA line whose position is jumpered must be constrained Hi-Z (block E)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
